                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A game in the vein of \"Tiny Robots\" or \"Tiny Rooms\", comprised of searches for needed objects to advance, accompanied by jigsaw puzzles, plumbing puzzles, mechanical construction, space invaders-like arcade games, etc.  In other words, an assortment of things to do, all in a colorfully cartoonish environment.  I had a blast even though I ended with one missing puzzle piece.  Oh, and I swatted lots of mosquitoes in order to get some hints.  A very creative game, worth the $1.08 I paid for it.",
